    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwnayima yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, hati imutsya amaisho gaawe, oreebe aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. Ntyo naagaimutsya, naareebayo, kandi reeba, aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho bwa'ah'orikutaahira omu irembo ry'eitambiro hakaba hariho ekishushani ekirikureetera Ruhanga eihato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 36:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaagaruka yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, nooreeba ebi barikukora? Nooreeba ebihagaro by'eihano ebi ab'enju ya Israeli barikukorera aha, ebirikumbinga nkaza hare n'Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera? Kwonka noija kureeba ebindi bihagaro by'eihano ebirikukira ebyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beanyima yantwara aha irembo ry'ekyo kikaari; ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba ekishenshero omu rugo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, hangusya ekyo kishenshero. Ntyo ku naahereize kukihangusya, naareeba orwigi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagaruka yangira ati: Taahamu, oreebe ebihagaro by'eihano ebi barikukorera aha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.1.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 1:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naanye naataahamu; ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba ebishushani by'emiringo yoona y'ebirikwekurura ahansi, n'eby'enyamaishwa ezirikunugwa, n'eby'ebishushani byona ebirikuramibwa ab'enju ya Israeli, biteirwe aha kisiika embaju zoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omu maisho gaabyo heemereiremu abashaija makumi mushanju ab'omu bakuru b'enju ya Israeli, n'ahagati yaabo heemereireho Yaazania mwene Shafani, buri omwe aine ekyoterero kye omu ngaro; obwo omwika gw'obubaane nigucumbuuka ahaiguru nigutaamirana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.9.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 9:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.10.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 10:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.29.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 29:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, ebyo waareeba ebi abakuru b'enju ya Israeli barikukorera omu mwirima, buri muntu omu bishengye by'ebishushani by'ebishushani by'ebiteekateeko bye? Ahabw'okuba nibagira bati: MUKAMA tarikutureeba; MUKAMA atsigireho ensi yaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagaruka yangira ati: Noija kureeba ebindi bihagaro by'eihano ebi barikukora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
